Use your three Aikatsu cards to coordinate an outfit,

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:58.430
and prepare to take the stage.

00:16:58.430 --> 00:16:59.080
Understood!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.070
Aoi, let's go out there and do it!

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.120
Yeah!

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:39.280
Your score for the audition will be decided by examiners from the school, the live audience,

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:43.150
and also from viewers watching on the web.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:45.890
Aoi-neesan, go for it!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.230
You too, Onee-chan!

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:50.740
<i>There are so many people watching me!</i>

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.080
<i>I've gotta give it my all!</i>

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.800
Oh, Ichigo-chan...

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:18.200
The winner is...

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:23.910
Kiriya Aoi!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:27.910
Congratulations!

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:30.210
Aoi, congrats!

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.960
Yeah, thanks!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:56.540
<i>The audition was fun, but...</i>

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:59.840
<i>I guess Aoi's gonna be Mizuki-chan's manager.</i>

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.800
<i>How lucky...</i>

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.190
Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:04.950
Huh?

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.330
I saw your audition today.

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:14.710
Mizuki-san!

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:18.700
Even though you fell, you followed through until the end. {comma where, bitch}

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:20.710
Th-Thank you very much!

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:23.560
Umm...

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:29.340
I want to become a top idol just like you.

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:31.220
That's the reason I came to this school.

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:33.460
I'll try my best!

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:36.090
I'll become a top idol alongside Aoi!

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:38.220
I wonder about that.{..}

00:21:39.380 --> 00:21:42.090
You understood from today's audition, right?

00:21:42.090 --> 00:21:45.120
No matter how close you two are,

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:47.240
you won't be able to continue rising together.

00:21:50.550 --> 00:21:52.920
For every person standing on the stage, {no ellipse here, silly}

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:57.670
there are dozens of people who are suffering because they couldn't make it.

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:00.670
That is the world of idols.

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:05.240
Your battles from here on will only become harsher and harsher.

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:10.880
S-Still, I'll do my best.

00:22:12.460 --> 00:22:15.180
I wonder if you'll be able to make it and catch up with me.

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:16.140
Huh?

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:19.020
Well then, good night.

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:22.450
Have a good night!

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:09.800
Aoi became Mizuki-chan's temporary manager; I'm so jealous!

00:24:10.270 --> 00:24:11.720
I'll secretly follow after her!

00:24:12.110 --> 00:24:13.050
What?!

00:24:13.050 --> 00:24:14.590
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:16.490
I want to know more about you.

00:24:16.490 --> 00:24:19.890
Always passionate, Idol Activities!

00:24:30.980 --> 00:24:32.810
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:24:33.960 --> 00:24:36.310
Starlight Academy's full of idols.

00:24:36.310 --> 00:24:38.170
It's a utopia for idol-lovers!

00:24:38.170 --> 00:24:39.850
Aoi, is that an aphorism?

00:24:39.850 --> 00:24:41.600
Then how about this?

00:24:41.600 --> 00:24:44.330
Everything hinges on the lessons we'll be taking now!

00:24:44.330 --> 00:24:44.900
Right!
